{
 "duration": 26.124,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every January, Jen promised herself she would hike more.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.572
  },
  {
   "text": "By March, her boots were back in the closet.",
   "start": 4.022,
   "end": 6.352
  },
  {
   "text": "The goal was fine. She just had no plan.",
   "start": 6.852,
   "end": 9.232
  },
  {
   "text": "So this year, she printed one and put it on the fridge.",
   "start": 9.782,
   "end": 12.627
  },
  {
   "text": "One hike a week, a trail picked for every month, long weekends already marked.",
   "start": 13.076,
   "end": 17.833
  },
  {
   "text": "After every hike, she colored in the miles.",
   "start": 18.333,
   "end": 20.631
  },
  {
   "text": "By December, the whole page was full.",
   "start": 21.131,
   "end": 23.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before you set next year's goals.",
   "start": 23.67,
   "end": 25.924
  }
 ],
